{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30423","headline":"秋日吴中观贡藕 · 赵嘏","name":"秋日吴中观贡藕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野艇几西东，清泠映碧空。\n褰衣来水上，捧玉出泥中。\n叶乱田田绿，莲余片片红。\n激波才入选，就日已生风。\n御洁玲珑膳，人怀拔擢功。\n梯山谩多品，不与世流同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}